### 35. Empty cart la order (400)
POST {{base}}/api/users/1/orders

### 36. Payment fail simulate
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "simulateFailure": true }

### 37. Payment retry, success
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "simulateFailure": false }

### 38. Already paid, thirumba pay (400)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 39. PAID order cancel (400)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1/cancel

