### 64. Invalid limit (400)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/top-products?limit=0

### 65. Monthly revenue (current year)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/monthly-revenue

### 66. Monthly revenue 2025 (empty list)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/monthly-revenue?year=2025

### 67. Customer spend
GET {{base}}/api/reports/customer-spend

### 68. Customer spend, minimum 10000 (HAVING)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/customer-spend?minSpend=10000

### 69. Category sales
GET {{base}}/api/reports/category-sales

### 70. Products never ordered
GET {{base}}/api/reports/unsold-products